  <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#Dropout">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#Regularization"/>
    <rdfs:label>dropout</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Inverted dropout after a hidden layer's activation: drops a fraction of the values in training mode and rescales the rest; the identity in evaluation mode.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
  <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#DropoutLayer">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#LayerType"/>
    <rdfs:label>Dropout</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Inverted dropout layer with its own seeded random generator.</rdfs:comment>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
  <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#EDAFigures">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#Figure"/>
    <rdfs:label>reports/figures/eda/&lt;name&gt;_&lt;stamp&gt;.png</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Exploratory plots of the first seed's training split: class balance, pairplot, correlation heatmap, target distribution and the scaling comparison. Written by plots.py during make train.</rdfs:comment>
