    <rdfs:comment>One file per framework (tensorflow_tuned, pytorch_tuned) in the benchmark results' record format: one record per architecture, task and seed, all using the configuration Optuna tuned on the tuning seed's validation set. Written by benchmarks/tuning.py (make tune); read by benchmarks/report.py as two more libraries.</rdfs:comment>
    <nnfs:belongsToStage rdf:resource="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#BenchmarkStage"/>
