    <rdfs:label>configs/tuning_experiments.json</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment>Hyperparameter tuning of the TensorFlow and PyTorch models with Optuna: the libraries and architectures, the tuning seed, the TPE sampler's seed, the number of trials and the search space (optimizer, learning rate, batch size, weight decay, dropout).</rdfs:comment>
    <nnfs:belongsToStage rdf:resource="https://github.com/ChristoforosAntoniadis/neural-network-numpy/ontology#InputsStage"/>
